{#-
Edge request-header hygiene, shared by every Traefik route template.

request_headers(indent) emits one `Name: ""` line per header, each on a new
line indented by `indent` spaces, for a headers middleware's
customRequestHeaders. Traefik deletes a request header whose configured value
is empty, so a client cannot choose:

- an identity a backend might take from a proxy (Remote-User and friends);
- a client address other than the one Traefik writes (True-Client-IP,
  Forwarded and other alternatives to X-Forwarded-For);
- a scheme or path prefix (X-Forwarded-Prefix, X-Forwarded-Ssl, ...);
- gunicorn's SCRIPT_NAME/PATH_INFO, which it takes from its loopback peer.

X-Forwarded-For, X-Real-Ip and X-Forwarded-Host/-Port/-Proto/-Server are not
listed: no entry point trusts forwarded headers, so Traefik replaces the
client's values with its own; deleting them would remove Traefik's.

Use it in a template rendered through ops_deploy.core.templates.template_loader:

  {% import "_edge.j2" as edge %}
          customRequestHeaders:
            X-Forwarded-Proto: https
  {{- edge.request_headers(12) }}

tests/test_traefik_edge_headers.py keeps every route template on it.
-#}
{%- set EDGE_DELETED_REQUEST_HEADERS = [
    "Remote-User",
    "Remote-Email",
    "Remote-Name",
    "Remote-Groups",
    "X-Remote-User",
    "X-Forwarded-User",
    "X-Forwarded-Email",
    "X-Forwarded-Groups",
    "X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username",
    "X-Auth-Request-User",
    "X-Auth-Request-Email",
    "X-WEBAUTH-USER",
    "True-Client-IP",
    "CF-Connecting-IP",
    "X-Client-IP",
    "X-Cluster-Client-IP",
    "Fastly-Client-IP",
    "X-Original-Forwarded-For",
    "Forwarded",
    "X-Forwarded-Prefix",
    "X-Forwarded-Uri",
    "X-Forwarded-Method",
    "X-Forwarded-Ssl",
    "X-Forwarded-Protocol",
    "X-Forwarded-Scheme",
    "X-Url-Scheme",
    "X-Script-Name",
    "SCRIPT_NAME",
    "PATH_INFO",
] -%}
{%- macro request_headers(indent) -%}
{{ "\n" ~ (" " * indent) ~ "# Deleted: a client must not choose its identity, address or path prefix (ops-deploy _edge.j2)." }}
{%- for name in EDGE_DELETED_REQUEST_HEADERS -%}
{{ "\n" ~ (" " * indent) ~ name ~ ': ""' }}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endmacro -%}
